"Show live previews" = "顯示即時預覽";
"To show thumbnails of your windows, macOS asks for Screen Recording. It's optional: the App Icons and List styles work without it." = "若要顯示視窗縮覽圖，macOS 會要求螢幕錄製權限。這是選用的：App 圖像和列表樣式不需要此權限即可使用。";
"By default, it only takes still pictures of windows while the switcher is open." = "預設情況下，它只會在切換器打開時拍攝視窗的靜態畫面。";
"It never records video or sound, and never saves or uploads anything." = "它絕不會錄製影片或聲音，也絕不會儲存或上傳任何內容。";
"macOS will ask to quit and reopen GlideTab. It comes right back to this step." = "macOS 會要求結束並重新打開 GlideTab。重新打開後會直接回到這一步。";
"Screen Recording is on" = "螢幕錄製已開啟";
"You're all set" = "一切就緒";
"Hold ⌥ Option, press Tab, and let go to switch." = "按住 ⌥ Option 鍵，按下 Tab 鍵，放開即可切換。";
"GlideTab lives in the menu bar." = "GlideTab 位於選單列中。";
"Type while the switcher is open to search." = "切換器打開時直接輸入即可搜尋。";
"Get Started" = "開始";
"Continue" = "繼續";
"Done" = "完成";
"Back" = "返回";
"Skip" = "略過";
"Couldn't reach GitHub. Check your internet connection and try again." = "無法連線至 GitHub。請檢查網際網路連線，然後再試一次。";
"Move GlideTab to Applications?" = "要將 GlideTab 移到「應用程式」檔案夾嗎？";
"GlideTab works best from the Applications folder. There it can update itself, and it stays put when you clean up Downloads." = "GlideTab 在「應用程式」檔案夾中執行效果最佳。在那裡它可以自動更新，清理「下載項目」時也不會被刪掉。";
"Move to Applications" = "移到「應用程式」";
"GlideTab couldn't be moved. Drag it to the Applications folder in Finder, then open it from there." = "無法移動 GlideTab。請在 Finder 中將它拖到「應用程式」檔案夾，然後從那裡打開。";
"GlideTab needs to be in the Applications folder to install updates." = "GlideTab 需要位於「應用程式」檔案夾中才能安裝更新。";
